          <div class="seg s3">3 · Sign-off<small>who checks output</small></div>
          <div class="seg s4">4 · One owner<small>reviewed quarterly</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat"><div class="n">58%</div><div class="l">of small businesses use generative AI</div><div class="src">US Chamber of Commerce, 2025</div></div>
